{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手JW(王灝兒)今日無預警宣布雙喜臨門，正式宣布與男友王至尊拉埋天窗外，更推出全新愛情結晶品《JW2情歌》，她除了將一段「至尊愛情」譜進新歌《JW2情歌》外，同時「派帖」示意與摯愛展開人生的新一頁！</p><p>《JW2情歌》由KW朱敏希作曲填詞、Di</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:04:51.826660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:41:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.442740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:17.442740+00:00","content_hash":"a8d3b3a8316f16ee0d15e96644ae1d6913379f17657ef778ba3e512831afac90","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}